cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research software and identify the release or commit used."
type: software
title: "Revocation Closure: Reproducible Research Artifacts for Agentic Legal Workflows"
abstract: >-
  Executable research artifacts accompanying After the Clawback:
  Revocation Closure in Agentic Legal Workflows. The repository includes
  source-linked court-order coding, fixed synthetic evaluation inputs,
  agent and recipient implementations, physical SQLite effects,
  and independent reproduction audits.
authors:
